# argot output
.argot/
**/.argot/
# argot dogfoods itself with the built-in defaults (its tests/docs/benchmarks
# are the recommended set), so a root config written by `just dogfood` is
# throwaway. Anchored to root so the tracked benchmarks/catalogs/*/argot.toml
# corpus configs are unaffected.
/argot.toml
/argot.local.toml

